-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Magma Coat\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Magma_Coat_4447a7.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot5\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Magma Legs\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Magma_Legs_f27249.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Maps and Pictures</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"map\">\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Percht Island 1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"118\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Percht_Island_1_24d276.png\" width=\"125\"/></span> <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Percht Island 2\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"103\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Percht_Island_2_bc1680.png\" width=\"125\"/></span> <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Percht Island 3\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"113\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Percht_Island_3_f3c610.png\" width=\"125\"/></span> <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Percht Island 4\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"105\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Percht_Island_4_d1cbd2.png\" width=\"125\"/></span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">12.02.7746<br/>December 11, 2018<br/>Winterlight Solstice Update</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p>The <b>Percht Island</b> is a secret island that can only be reached when the <a href=\"#/quest/winterlight-solstice\">Winterlight Solstice</a> begins. To visit it, use the small boat that is anchored nearby <a href=\"#/wiki/Svargrond\">Svargrond</a>'s harbor.\n</p><p>This island shares a location with the <a href=\"#/wiki/Orcsoberfest%20Island\">Orcsoberfest Island</a>, which is why it may odd on the Automap if you have visited both of them. Which area is active depends on the event that is running. You can see the map that corresponds only to the Percht Island on the images to the right. The region that hosts the island is called Secluded Island, and that's the name that appears in e.g. the <a href=\"#/wiki/Cyclopedia\">Bestiary</a> of the creatures.\n</p><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Percht Island 1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"290\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Percht_Island_1_24d276.png\" width=\"306\"/></span>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Bonny%20Bunny\"><img alt=\"Bonny Bunny\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wik